  "question": {
    "text": "If the length of the major axis of the ellipse <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is three times the length of minor axis, its eccentricity is"
